cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use In Your Words or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "In Your Words: a witness interview that can only ask about what you said"
abstract: >-
  A self-administered witness interview on Firebase AI Logic hybrid inference. Gemini Nano writes follow-up questions
  on the device, and deterministic code refuses any question that uses a word the witness never said or that can be
  answered yes or no. A SHA-256 fingerprint of the whole interview is sealed in Firestore with the server's time.
